ufanthin.","poem":2}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"text":"Bayi fel’ u wun’ug e pi’in yad ba yul’yul’ ngak Got","poem":1},{"text":"ma bay gu pagrad ngar pired rog u tafen e pilung.","poem":2},{"text":"Pi’in nri yad ba yul’yul’","poem":1},{"text":"e ni pagrad ngar pigpiggad ngog.","poem":2}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"text":"Dariy ba sasalap l’ugun nra par u naun rog;","poem":1},{"text":"dariy be’ nma dake modingnag ir nra par u p’eowcheg.","poem":2}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"text":"Gubin e rran ni bay gu thirif u but’","poem":1},{"text":"e pi’in kireb u daken e but’ rodad;","poem":2},{"text":"bay gu thurbeg urngin e pi’in kireb e leam rorad","poem":1},{"text":"ngar chuwgad ko fare binaw rok SOMOL.","poem":2}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/yap_bsm/PSA/101.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/yap_bsm/PSA/102.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/yap_bsm/PSA/100.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":8}